1. Introduction
Say:
"Good morning/afternoon. Our project is EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant."
2. Project Purpose
Explain:
"The purpose of EduGenie is to provide students with an AI-powered learning assistant that helps them understand concepts, answer questions, generate quizzes, summarize content and create personalized learning paths."
3. Explain the Interface
Show your EduGenie homepage and explain the available options:
Explain
Q&A
Quiz
Summary
Recommend Path
4. Demonstrate Q&A
Enter a question → Submit → Show the generated answer.
5. Demonstrate Explanation
Enter a difficult topic → Select Explain → Show the simplified explanation.
6. Demonstrate Quiz
Enter a passage → Select Quiz → Show the generated MCQs.
7. Demonstrate Summary
Enter a long paragraph → Select Summary → Show the concise result.
8. Demonstrate Learning Path
Enter a topic such as SQL → Select Recommend Path → Show the beginner-to-advanced learning recommendations.
9. Final Output
Show all the completed features and explain how they help students.
10. Closing
Say:
"This concludes our demonstration of EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant. Thank you."
